OL,3,GNEWSARally held over proposed          
OL,4,Auniversity cuts                        
OL,6,FA university has been urged to rethink 
OL,7,Fproposals to make #40m of savings with 
OL,8,Fthe loss of nearly 200 jobs, including 
OL,9,Fteaching staff.                        
OL,11,FStudents, lecturers and former         
OL,12,Flecturers demonstrated against the     
OL,13,Fproposed cuts outside the main campus  
OL,14,Fof the University of Sunderland (UoS). 
OL,16,FMedical student Basil Almashharawi said
OL,17,Fthe action was necessary as the losses 
OL,18,F"raised alarm bells" over the impact to
OL,19,Fhis education.                         
