OL,6,FThe UoS said it was "operating in a    
OL,7,Fchallenging financial environment" and 
OL,8,Fproposed cuts affected a "small        
OL,9,Fproportion" of its health and sciences 
OL,10,Fsubjects, but no final decision had    
OL,11,Fbeen taken.                            
